Subject: [PATCH 05/24] beta-mode: quant.beta_mode {absmean, absmean_pow2,
 learned_pow2} (M022, M023)

---
 code/bnhgq2/ablation.py   |  3 +++
 code/bnhgq2/binarize.py   | 14 +++++++---
